    14	
    15	   Recalculation on the frozen 928-window pool gives \(W_g\) min/10th/50th/90th/max = 0/6/58/449/2670, with 333 distinct values. Applying the exact proposed rule to all 103 target-specific magnitude pools gives three strictly distinct values for 103/103 targets: K0 ranges 0–23, K1 8–127, and K2 100–786.
