     1	"""Contract tests for the D2 shard generation (G3 round-1 findings).
     2	
     3	A miniature pool (4 real-shaped ZTF windows) and 3 synthetic Romero-like
     4	targets run through the REAL builder, then through the REAL metrics readers:
     5	  * fixed typed manifest schema, every arm fully populated (M1/N1)
     6	  * explicit scenario codes; dropout never pooled with nominal (M2/N2)
     7	  * dropout scheduled only for >= 2 retained modes; zero-retained targets excluded
     8	  * campaign-id layout (S=3 dropout code, crowding digit), no collisions (N6)
     9	  * staging + atomic publish, sentinel, generation manifest, SHA identity (M3/M5)
    10	  * bitwise epoch round-trip through the frozen loader (M7)
    11	  * truth_d2 consumes the full default manifest and refuses tampering (M1/M4)
    12	  * cluster bootstrap keeps scenarios apart and uses scheduled strata (M2)
    13	  * stratified pilot index spans every arm (M8)
    14	"""
