    17	
    18	- **detection completeness** — P(rule fires | labeled positive), reported for
    19	  BOTH denominators: `eligible_roster` (missing/unusable light curves count
    20	  as non-detections) and `usable_lightcurve` (frozen QC passed, both passes
    21	  complete). D1 denominators: the 13 paper-variable stars of the published
    22	  19-star master table (the 928-star catalog is NOT a labeled-positive
    23	  completeness denominator). D3: the 610 dSct=1 survivors. D2: injection
    24	  targets — always labeled *conditional injection-recovery efficiency of the
    25	  search stage*. Amendment 4: the D2 PRIMARY endpoint is injected-signal
    26	  RECOVERY (rule 1 fires AND the best candidate directly matches the
