    75	   nulls 1,000; plus the stretch `redilution` arm (20 SPOC-verified targets)
    76	   ⇒ 3,102 shards on the current inputs (core ≤ 3,299). The builder refuses
    77	   to publish unless generation_manifest.json says production=true.
    78	2. Self-window diagnostic (DONE on the laptop): frozen fetcher on
    79	   `selfwindow_roster.csv` (96-prefix); usable crossmatches form a separate
    80	   diagnostic arm only.
    81	3. Stratified pilot (LAPTOP; ~150 shards spanning every arm/scenario; never
    82	   confirmatory):
    83	   `python scripts/generalization/run_generalization_ls.py
    84	    --shard-dir outputs/generalization/d2_shards_gen2
    85	    --shard-index outputs/generalization/d2_shards_gen2/shard_index.txt
    86	    --stars-file outputs/generalization/d2_shards_gen2/pilot_shard_index.txt
    87	    --out-dir outputs/generalization/d2_pilot_gen2 --dataset d2-tess-dav
    88	    --work-root C:/ls_scratch/d2_pilot_gen2 --workers 12
    89	    --replay-report outputs/generalization/replay_gate_full/replay_report.json`
    90	   Archive with every pilot record: metrics/, run/manifest.json,
    91	   run/completion.csv, run/stars/ (raw result JSONs AND .prov.json sidecars).
    92	4. Full run (LAPTOP): the same command WITHOUT `--stars-file` and with
    93	   `--out-dir outputs/generalization/d2_run --work-root C:/ls_scratch/d2_run`
    94	   (resume-safe: sidecar-bound; `--workers 12` — the laptop saturates there).
    95	5. Metrics (laptop or Mac): `python scripts/generalization/metrics_generalization.py
    96	    --dataset d2 --shards-dir <d2_shards_gen2>
    97	    --stars-dir <d2_run/stars> --run-manifest <d2_run/manifest.json>
    98	    --out-dir generalization/results/<date>_d2/metrics`
    99	   (shard index defaults to `<generation>/shard_index.txt`; for a pilot add
   100	   `--stars-file <generation>/pilot_shard_index.txt`; completion.csv must
   101	   sit beside manifest.json).
   102	
   103	## Results bundles
   104	
   105	`generalization/results/<date>_<dataset>/` mirroring the published
   106	convention: README, DATA_PROVENANCE, SHA256SUMS, acceptance.json, metrics/,
   107	figures/. G5 re-derives every headline number from per_star.csv + JSONs.
   108	
   109	## Attested production machine (2026-08-29)
   110	
   111	Laptop `Jacks_7i_5090` full-928 replay gate **PASS** (15 workers, 13 h;
   112	921 `identical_v1_schema` + 7 `identical_newline`; python 3.12.12, numpy 2.3.5,
   113	scipy 1.16.3, astropy 8.0.1, pandas 2.3.3, Windows 11). Report on the laptop:
   114	`outputs\generalization\replay_gate_full\replay_report.json` (= the
   115	`--replay-report` argument for every production `run_generalization_ls.py`
   116	invocation); archived copy in
   117	`generalization/attestation/laptop_replay_full_2026-08-29/`.
   118	Mac (M5, macOS arm64) is NOT an attested machine: strict tier fails on bytes
   119	(BLAS/FMA/CSV-parse last-bit), the 928-star decision-equivalence evidence run was
   120	stopped at 311/928 (battery) — partial record in
   121	`outputs/generalization/replay_gate_mac_full/PARTIAL_RUN_ATTESTATION.json`.
   122	Rule: multi-hour compute on the Mac only on mains power; default to the laptop.

